 "source": {
  "notes": "The source identifies a rhombohedral B1 distortion from splitting of 111 and 220 and indexes 003, 101, 102, 104, 110, and 105 reflections, but it does not state a unique space group, complete cell metric, or refined fractional coordinates. Those crystallographic fields are therefore not inferred. The executable EOS uses a one-formula-unit primitive volume basis obtained directly from the reported atomic volumes.",
